{"THANKS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|rep=good,best",{"Thank YOU, truly, for everything, you've done more than you know","You don't have to thank me. After what you've done for us, I owe you a year of this","Please, it's me who should be thanking you, you saved us","Don't mention it, I mean it, and I mean it twice","It was nothing, compared to what you've done for us","Think nothing of it, we're even, or better, you're ahead","Aw, shucks, you're making me blush","Aw, my pleasure, really","That's what friends are for","I'd do it again in a heartbeat","Nobody says that anymore. I'm going to hold on to it for a while","Come on, no need, we look after each other","You're the one who deserves the thanks","No, no, no, thank YOU, for being you","It's a pleasure helping someone like you","Anytime, any day, any hour","It was an honor","Pay it forward, that's all I ask","You're too kind, too kind by half","It's nothing, really, really nothing","Sure thing, any time","It was the least I could do, honestly","Go on now, God keep you","Thanks right back at you, a hundred times over","Stop it, you'll make me cry","Just doing what anyone would do","God, that means a lot, really","No thanks needed, but I'll take them, they feel good","Let's call it even, then, and have a drink"}},
